                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "nit: can we simplify this to remove the local variable? \ud83d\ude0a\n\n```suggestion\n\n    if constexpr (BMCWEB_EXPERIMENTAL_REDFISH_MULTI_COMPUTER_SYSTEM)\n    {\n        return std::format(\"xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host{}\",\n                                       computerSystemIndex);\n    }\n\n    return \"xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host\";\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/include/utils/systems_utils.hpp",
                    "line": 240,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Oliver Brewka",
                        "email": "oliver.brewka@9elements.com",
                        "username": "mox669"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/include/utils/systems_utils.hpp",
                    "line": 251,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
